<div id="S3.SS2.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS2.p6.1" class="ltx_p">A 500-step extension ran six trajectories at depth six, with no defence and
with mid-lite, over three training seeds, and two machines reproduced the
saved-prediction analysis and verified every log. The inversion attack
recovered 81.22–81.73% of tokens with no defence and 0.04–0.85% with
mid-lite, below its 4.83–4.96% majority baseline. This extends the same
declared setting to 500 steps and confirms the verdict across three seeds and
two independently reproduced analyses.
The horizon, clustered and 500-step records are, respectively,
<a href="https://huggingface.co/datasets/Setloop/LLM-Attack-Suite/blob/v2.0/long-horizon-v1/report.json" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href"><span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink">long-horizon-v1/report.json</span></a>,
