<section id="S3.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">S3.5 </span>What strength is established</h3>

<div id="S3.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Attack strength depends on the observation and knowledge grants, corpus,
budget, target and control. Table <a href="#S3.T10" title="Table S10 ‣ S3.5 What strength is established ‣ S3 Detailed Experimental Results ‣ LLM-Attack Suite: A Unified Red-Team Framework for PrivacyEvaluation of Split and Distributed LLM Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">S10</span></a> separates the
shared confirmatory GPT-2 campaign from independent audits and qualification
studies. Together they establish structural leakage, corpus sensitivity,
implementation fidelity, published-attack conformance and module behaviour.</p>
</div>
